      'Продуктовые IT-гиганты — Spotify, Airbnb, Uber, Netflix, Ozon, Tinkoff',
      'B2B SaaS компании — Salesforce, HubSpot, Atlassian, Miro',
      'Fintech — Stripe, Square, PayPal, Revolut, Tinkoff, Sber',
      'E-commerce & Marketplaces — Amazon, Ozon, Wildberries, Avito',
      'Consumer Apps — Instagram, TikTok, Telegram, WhatsApp, VK',
      'Enterprise Software — SAP, Oracle, Microsoft (Cloud Division)',
      'Gaming — Epic Games, Roblox, Unity (platform products)',
