        'IDS/IPS — Suricata, Snort, Palo Alto Threat Prevention: чтение IDS alerts, понимание signatures/rules, туning для снижения false positives, анализ network-based attacks (port scans, exploit attempts, C2 communication)',
        'EDR (Endpoint Detection and Response) — CrowdStrike Falcon, Microsoft Defender ATP, SentinelOne, Carbon Black: анализ endpoint telemetry (process creation, network connections, file modifications), investigation suspicious processes, malware indicators (suspicious parent-child process relationships, unusual network connections)',
        'Windows Security — Windows Event Log analysis (Event IDs: 4624 успешный logon, 4625 failed logon, 4672 admin logon, 4688 process creation), Active Directory logs, PowerShell logging, Sysmon (advanced Windows logging tool), понимание Windows attack vectors (Pass-the-Hash, Kerberoasting, mimikatz)',
        'Linux Security — Linux log analysis (/var/log/auth.log, syslog, kernel logs), common Linux attack vectors (SSH brute-force, privilege escalation via SUID binaries, cron job abuse), bash history analysis, file integrity monitoring (AIDE, Tripwire)',
        'OSINT (Open Source Intelligence) — сбор информации из публичных источников для threat intel: VirusTotal (malware analysis, file hash reputation), Shodan (internet-connected devices search), passive DNS (historical DNS records), WHOIS lookups, threat actor research',
        'Basic malware analysis — static analysis (file hash lookup, VirusTotal submission, strings analysis), dynamic analysis basics (sandbox execution в ANY.RUN, Cuckoo Sandbox), understanding malware families (ransomware, trojans, botnets), malware IOC extraction',
        'Forensics basics — disk forensics (Autopsy, FTK), memory forensics (Volatility), timeline analysis, chain of custody, evidence preservation. L1 обычно не делает deep forensics, но L2/L3 проводят basic forensic investigations',
