      'Кибербезопасность vendors — Kaspersky Lab, Positive Technologies, Security Code, BI.ZONE, разработка security products (антивирусы, SIEM, DLP), need для secure coding practices (dogfooding), offensive security research',
      'Healthtech и медицинские платформы — СберЗдоровье, Доктор рядом, DocDoc, обработка medical data (HIPAA-like requirements), increasing digitalization healthcare, telemedicine security challenges',
      'Crypto и blockchain компании — DeFi protocols, crypto exchanges (Garantex, WhiteBIT), blockchain infrastructure, smart contract security (Solidity audits), high-value targets (millions $ at risk), need для secure development practices',
