    demand: `Спрос на UX/UI-дизайнеров один из highest в IT-индустрии — 4000-6000 вакансий "UX/UI designer" + "Product Designer" на hh.ru, устойчивый рост 20-30% year-over-year, особенно critical shortage Senior/Lead designers.

Основные драйверы спроса: (1) Digital transformation — каждая компания становится tech компанией, need для digital products (websites, mobile apps, SaaS платформы), user experience competitive differentiator (плохой UX → users уходят к конкурентам). (2) Mobile-first world — smartphone penetration 80%+ в России, mobile traffic превышает desktop, every product нуждается в mobile design, responsive design non-negotiable. (3) Product-led growth — SaaS компании rely на good UX для user acquisition (free trials, self-service onboarding), плохой UX directly impacts conversion rates и churn. (4) Remote work boom — pandemic accelerated remote work, companies comfortable hiring designers remotely (geography не barrier), international companies hiring из России с dollar salaries. (5) Design maturity growing — российские компании понимают value хорошего дизайна (historically "делали как получится"), investment в design teams increasing, design getting seat at the table alongside PM/engineering.

Отрасли с highest demand: E-commerce platforms (Ozon, Wildberries, Lamoda — constant need improving shopping experience, conversion optimization, mobile apps), финтех & банки (Тинькофф, Альфа-Банк, Сбер — сложные financial products require excellent UX, regulatory compliance + usability challenge), SaaS & B2B продукты (JetBrains, Miro, PandaDoc — enterprise products, complex workflows, focus на productivity), маркетплейсы (Avito, Циан, HeadHunter — two-sided marketplaces, balancing buyer/seller needs), digital-агентства (Red Keds, Nimax, Лёгкие решения — client work variety, from landing pages to enterprise systems), стартапы на growth stage (Series A-C companies building MVP → product-market fit, rapid iteration, high impact), медиа и контент (vc.ru, Pikabu, Yandex.Zen — engagement optimization, reading experience), healthtech (СберЗдоровье, DocDoc — telemedicine apps, booking systems, medical data complexity).

Географическое распределение: Москва 50-60% вакансий (концентрация tech companies, highest salaries), Санкт-Петербург 15-20% (JetBrains, Яндекс SPb, growing design community), remote positions 40-50% (design most remote-friendly role в IT, location-independent work), региональные города 5-10% (Казань, Новосибирск, Екатеринбург — emerging tech hubs, lower salaries).

Требования работодателей: Portfolio critical (3-5 case studies showing process, not just final designs), Figma proficiency mandatory (80% вакансий explicitly требуют), understanding UX process (research → wireframes → testing, не только visual design), communication skills (presenting designs, explaining rationale), English B1-B2+ для international companies или tech companies с English внутри. Middle/Senior требуют: experience conducting user research, работа с design systems, mentoring juniors, cross-functional collaboration, shipped products в portfolio. Junior positions usually требуют bootcamp/courses certificate или relevant design degree, personal projects acceptable если high quality.

Типы вакансий: Product Designer (70% вакансий — broad role, UX+UI combined, working на продукте end-to-end), UX/UI Designer (15% — более traditional split, может быть separate UX и UI roles в больших компаниях), Mobile Designer (10% — specialization в iOS/Android apps, platform-specific guidelines), Web Designer (5% — focus на websites, landing pages, marketing materials, overlapping с graphic design).

Конкуренция: High для juniors (много bootcamp graduates, saturated entry-level market, нужен exceptional portfolio), moderate для middle (2-4 года experience creates differentiation, меньше кандидатов с real shipped products), low для senior/lead (shortage experienced designers кто может work independently, lead initiatives, mentor).

Прогноз на 5-10 лет: sustained high demand (20-25% annual growth), driven by continued digital transformation, emerging platforms (AR/VR interfaces — Apple Vision Pro, Meta Quest), AI-assisted design (tools like Galileo AI, Uizard — но не replacing designers, скорее augmenting), design systems maturity (more companies building design systems, need для specialists), accessibility regulations (increasing legal requirements WCAG compliance, hiring for a11y expertise). Design becoming more strategic role (не только execution, но и product direction input).`,
