    howToBecome: `Путь в UX research зависит от background — есть три main routes: Psychology/Sociology → UX Research (academic research skills → applied research), Product Analyst / Data Analyst → UX Research (quantitative background + adding qualitative methods), UX Designer → UX Research (design background + deepening research skills). Realistic timeline: 8-18 месяцев активного learning + practice.

**Psychology/Sociology Background (наиболее прямой путь):** Если у вас psychology или sociology degree, вы уже имеете foundation — research methods, statistics, interviewing skills. Нужно адаптировать academic research skills к product context. Изучите: product thinking (как research влияет на product decisions, ROI of research), usability testing методы (Jakob Nielsen, moderated testing, SUS scores), digital tools (Figma basics, analytics platforms, Maze для remote testing). Курсы: Interaction Design Foundation "User Research Methods and Best Practices" (3 месяца, $16/month subscription), Coursera "User Experience Research and Design Specialization" от University of Michigan (6 месяцев), Skillbox "UX-исследователь" (4 месяца онлайн). Практика: conduct usability tests на друзьях/коллегах (тестируйте популярные apps), volunteer research для startups (offer free research в обмен на portfolio piece), participate в research communities (ResearchOps Community, UX Russia).

**Analyst Background (quantitative → adding qualitative):** Если вы Product Analyst или Data Analyst, вы сильны в quantitative methods (analytics, surveys, A/B testing). Нужно добавить qualitative skills — user interviews, usability testing. Leverage ваш existing analytics expertise (это highly ценится в UX research), изучите interviewing techniques (active listening, open-ended questions, avoiding bias). Курсы: "Just Enough Research" by Erika Hall (книга-практикум, 2 недели reading + exercises), UX Research курсы на Coursera/Udemy. Практика: start adding qualitative layer к вашим analyst projects (проводите 5 user interviews после quantitative analysis to understand "why"), shadow experienced UX Researchers, offer to co-lead research studies с UX team.

**Designer Background (UX Designer → deeper research):** Если вы UX/UI Designer, вы уже проводите basic research (user interviews, usability testing). Нужно deepen methodological rigor, масштабировать research skills. Изучите advanced methods (diary studies, card sorting, longitudinal research), research synthesis techniques (thematic analysis, affinity mapping at scale), stakeholder management (presenting research readouts, influencing product strategy). Курсы: Nielsen Norman Group "UX Research Methods" certification (3-day intensive, $1795), IxDF courses on research. Практика: volunteer to lead research projects в вашей design team, build research repository (organize past research findings), mentor junior designers в research methods.

**Universal Steps:** (1) Build portfolio of 3-5 strong case studies — каждый case study должен показывать: research questions, methods used, synthesis process, insights, impact на product decisions. Include visuals (journey maps, affinity diagrams, data visualizations). (2) Learn tools hands-on — Maze (free tier для practice), UserTesting.com (apply as tester чтобы see platform), Hotjar (free tier), Dovetail (trial). (3) Practice interviewing — interview 20-30 people о любых topics (их morning routines, coffee preferences) to develop active listening, comfortable с silence. (4) Read foundational books — "The User Experience Team of One" by Leah Buley, "Just Enough Research" by Erika Hall, "Interviewing Users" by Steve Portigal. (5) Join community — ResearchOps Community Slack (3000+ members globally), UX Russia meetups, Mixed Methods podcast. (6) Start applying — Junior UXR roles (highlight transferable skills: interviewing, analysis, presentation), contract/freelance research projects (Upwork, Toptal для research gigs), internships в research teams.

Timeline: 8-12 месяцев если вы Psychology/Sociology background (focused курс + 3-4 practice projects), 12-18 месяцев если вы Analyst (adding qualitative skills), 6-10 месяцев если вы Designer (deepening existing research skills). First role likely Junior UXR 120-180K₽ или UX Researcher contract positions.`,
