    careerPath: `Типичный путь в Product Design: UX/UI Designer (2-4 года experience, strong design craft, начинаете думать about metrics и business impact) → Product Designer / Middle PD (4-7 лет, owning features end-to-end, full member of product triad, proactively contributing к product strategy) → Senior Product Designer (7-10 лет, leading complex initiatives, mentoring designers, significant influence на product direction, thought leadership) → Lead Product Designer (10-12+ лет, managing small design team 2-4 people или leading design для large product area, setting design standards) → Principal Product Designer (12-15+ лет, IC track, thought leadership, cross-product initiatives, setting company-wide design strategy) или Head of Design / Design Director (management track, managing design teams 10-30 people, hiring, process development, design org leadership).

Альтернативные треки: Product Designer → Product Manager (design background highly valuable в PM, ~30% Product Designers transition к PM через 5-7 лет), Design Strategy Consultant (leveraging product thinking plus design craft в consulting), founding startups as designer-founder (strong product sense plus execution skills), Creative Director (brand plus product design leadership), Design Educator (teaching design в bootcamps/universities).

Ключевые milestones для роста: от Mid к Senior — demonstrating measurable impact (tracking metrics improvements from your designs, "my redesign increased conversion by 18%"), strategic contributions (not just executing PM requests, но proactively identifying opportunities), mentorship (helping junior designers grow). От Senior к Lead/Principal — building design systems at scale, influencing product strategy significantly (PM seeks your input before planning), thought leadership (conference talks, writing, contributing к design community), managing ambiguity на complex problems.

Career velocity зависит от: portfolio quality (case studies showing impact, not just pretty pixels), company context (fast-growing startups offer faster growth чем mature companies), continuous learning (staying updated с tools, patterns, methodologies), networking (design community involvement accelerates opportunities).`,
