    careerPath: `Типичный путь в Motion Design: Junior Motion Designer (0-2 года, working on simple UI animations под supervision, learning After Effects, basic Lottie export, 3-5 animations per sprint) → Motion Designer / Middle (2-4 года, owning animation projects independently, creating explainer videos, complex UI flows, Lottie optimization, mentoring juniors) → Senior Motion Designer (4-7 лет, leading animation strategy для product features, setting motion design standards, complex interactive animations, managing animation libraries) → Lead Motion Designer (7-10 plus лет, managing motion design team 2-5 people, defining motion design system для entire product, cross-product animation consistency) или Art Director (creative leadership, visual direction beyond just motion, brand evolution).

Альтернативные треки: Motion Designer → 3D Motion Designer (specializing в Cinema 4D/Blender, creating 3D product animations, brand films), Creative Technologist (code-based animation, creative coding с Three.js/WebGL), Animation Director (leading animation studios, client work), UX/UI Designer (transitioning к broader design role, motion as one skill), Video Production (expanding к full video content creation, commercials, branded content).

Рост зависит от: portfolio quality (showreel showing range: UI animations plus explainer videos plus experimental work, 60-90 seconds), technical mastery (After Effects expressions, advanced Lottie optimization, performance tuning), understanding product context (aligning animations с business goals, не просто "making it pretty"), leadership (mentoring, setting standards, building motion culture).`,
