    howToBecome: `Путь в Motion Design typically начинается с visual design или animation background, но можно войти и с нуля. Realistic timeline: 6-12 месяцев intensive learning plus portfolio building для Junior positions.

Learn After Effects Fundamentals (3-4 месяца): Adobe After Effects — primary tool motion designers. Start с basics: (1) Interface и workflow — composition setup, layers, timeline navigation, preview rendering. (2) Keyframe animation — animating position, scale, rotation, opacity properties, understanding keyframes как building blocks. (3) Graph Editor mastery — crafting easing curves (ease-in, ease-out, custom bezier), understanding how curves affect motion feel. (4) Expressions basics — JavaScript-based automation (wiggle, loop, linking properties), time-saving для repetitive animations. Курсы: School of Motion "After Effects Kickstart" (6 weeks, $747, gold standard), Skillbox "Моушн-дизайнер" (6 месяцев онлайн), YouTube tutorials (Motion Design School бесплатные basics).

Master Animation Principles (ongoing): Study Disney 12 Principles — foundational для natural motion. Key principles: (1) Timing — speed creates mood (fast = energetic, slow = dramatic, typical UI 100-500ms). (2) Ease in/out — objects accelerate and decelerate naturally (nothing starts/stops instantly). (3) Anticipation — preparing viewers for action (button slightly scales down before bouncing up). (4) Follow through — elements continue moving after main action stops (creates realism). Practice applying each principle в small animation exercises. Resources: "The Illusion of Life" book by Frank Thomas and Ollie Johnston (Disney animators bible), "Animator's Survival Kit" by Richard Williams.

Learn Lottie Workflow (1-2 месяца): Lottie критичен для UI motion designers. (1) Install Bodymovin plugin в After Effects, learn export process. (2) Understand limitations — что Lottie supports vs workarounds (gradients, masks, expressions limited). (3) Optimization techniques — reducing file size (simplifying paths, removing unnecessary keyframes, target 50-200KB). (4) LottieFiles platform — testing animations, debugging issues, exploring community library. Practice creating simple UI animations и exporting к Lottie, testing в web/mobile contexts.

Build Portfolio (3-6 месяцев): Portfolio критичен — companies hire based на showreel. Create: (1) UI micro-interactions — 5-10 examples (button animations, loading states, transitions), showcase variety и attention to detail. (2) Explainer video — 30-90 second animated video explaining fake product/service, demonstrates storytelling plus character animation. (3) Experimental piece — creative project showing artistic range (не просто commercial work). (4) Showreel — 60-90 second compilation highlighting best work, music-synced, fast-paced. Post на Behance, Dribbble, create personal website. Quality > quantity — 10 polished pieces better чем 50 mediocre.

Understand UI/UX Context (ongoing): Motion designers работают embedded в product teams, нужно понимать UX principles. Learn: (1) UI design basics — typography, layout, color theory (чтобы понимать designs you animate). (2) UX patterns — common interaction patterns (navigation, forms, onboarding), когда motion helps vs hinders usability. (3) Platform guidelines — iOS Human Interface Guidelines, Material Design motion standards. (4) Accessibility — ensuring animations do not trigger vestibular disorders (prefers-reduced-motion CSS, limiting parallax). Read: "Designing Interface Animation" by Val Head, "Motion Design for iOS" by Mike Rundle.

Practice Projects: (1) Recreate animations you admire — analyze best UI animations (Stripe, Apple, Google), reverse-engineer в After Effects, understand techniques. (2) Daily animation challenges — commit to creating 1 animation per week, post publicly (accountability plus portfolio building). (3) Contribute to LottieFiles — upload quality animations к community library (visibility plus feedback). (4) Freelance gigs — take small freelance projects (Upwork, Fiverr) для real client experience.

Learn Supplementary Tools (optional но valuable): (1) Principle — UI animation prototyping (Mac-only, real-time preview, easier чем After Effects для simple interactions). (2) Adobe Illustrator — vector asset creation (preparing clean assets для After Effects). (3) Cinema 4D basics — 3D integration (bundled with After Effects, opens advanced opportunities). (4) Premiere Pro — video editing (for longer content creation).

Job Application Strategy: (1) Target Junior positions — start с companies hiring junior motion designers (agencies often more willing чем product companies). (2) Tailor showreel — customize showreel для each application (highlight UI work для product companies, explainer videos для agencies). (3) Network — join motion design communities (Motion Design Slack groups, School of Motion community), attend meetups. (4) Freelance bridge — freelance work builds portfolio plus experience while searching full-time.

Timeline: 6-9 месяцев если full-time learning (intensive courses plus daily practice), 9-12 месяцев если part-time (evenings/weekends). First role likely Junior Motion Designer 80-120K₽ или freelance projects 2000-4000₽/hour starting rate.`,
