    demand: `Спрос на 3D-дизайнеров средний но steadily growing — 600-1200 вакансий "3D Designer" + "3D Artist" на hh.ru (Москва, СПб, remote), 2500-4000 вакансий globally на LinkedIn. Demand driven by several trends: e-commerce product visualization replacing photography (IKEA, Wayfair generating 100% furniture images via 3D, 30-50% cost reduction vs photo shoots), web3D democratization (Spline, Three.js making browser 3D accessible, expected в premium websites), AR/VR mainstream adoption (Apple Vision Pro launch 2024, Meta Quest pushing VR, virtual try-on standard в fashion/furniture), spatial computing hype (3D interfaces for AR glasses, dimensional design becoming necessary skill).

Спрос concentrated в: e-commerce platforms (Wildberries, Ozon creating product 3D libraries), digital agencies (providing 3D services к clients), AR/VR companies (Varwin, VR Club, Modum Lab creating immersive experiences), game studios (mobile/PC games requiring 3D assets), architectural visualization firms (renders для real estate marketing), product design companies (prototyping, visualization).

Зарплаты: Junior 3D Designer 90-140K₽ (0-2 года, simple asset creation, learning workflows), Middle 160-280K₽ (2-4 года, independent project ownership, photorealistic renders), Senior 320-450K₽ (4-7 лет, complex scenes, characters, art direction), Lead 3D / Art Director 450-700K₽ (7-10 plus лет, managing teams, pipeline development). Зарубежные компании платят significantly higher: Mid $70-120K, Senior $120-180K. Freelance highly lucrative: product renders 5000-20000₽ per asset (jewelry, electronics higher), AR models 15000-50000₽, architectural visualization $500-2000 per room, characters $1000-5000.

Тренды: Blender overtaking paid software (50% industry adoption 2024 vs 20% in 2018, becoming industry standard), browser-based 3D tools emerging (Spline 500K users 2024, no download required), AI-assisted 3D (text-to-3D models via Luma AI/Meshy, AI texturing via Poly), real-time rendering becoming standard (Eevee, Unreal Engine quality improving, instant feedback vs hours rendering), NFT/metaverse creating 3D demand (digital fashion, virtual worlds, though hype cooling 2023-2024).

Конкуренция: moderate — more niche чем 2D design (smaller talent pool), но also fewer dedicated positions. Differentiators при hiring: strong portfolio (quality > quantity, 10 stunning pieces better than 50 mediocre), specialized skills (product viz, characters, AR/VR depth), technical proficiency (Three.js integration, optimization expertise), speed (balancing quality + delivery timelines).

Перспективы: excellent для тех с strong artistic foundation plus technical aptitude. Challenging для beginners (steep learning curve, portfolio barrier). Growth potential: 3D Designer → Senior 3D → Lead 3D (managing teams, art direction) или specialization (Character Artist $150K plus, Archviz specialist, Technical Artist). Lateral moves: transition к Game Development (Unity/Unreal), VR/AR Development (adding coding skills), Product Design (industrial design с 3D prototyping). International opportunities good — 3D universal language, remote work normalized, global client base accessible.`,
