        'Attention to Detail — pedantic precision и consistency: catching subtle inconsistencies (функция called "getUserData" в одном месте и "getUserInfo" в другом), meticulous proofreading (typos и grammar errors undermine credibility), verifying technical accuracy (testing что code examples actually work, что версии libraries в examples актуальны), maintaining style guide compliance',
