        'Self-motivation — independent work и continuous improvement: taking initiative находить documentation gaps без waiting для assignment (monitoring support channels для recurring questions → creating FAQ), seeking feedback proactively (asking colleagues review draft documentation), staying current с industry best practices (reading Write the Docs blog, attending documentation conferences/meetups, experimenting с emerging tools)',
