      'UX Writer / Content Designer — crafting microcopy для product interfaces: writing button labels, error messages, onboarding flows, empty states, tooltips (every word user sees in app), closely collaborating с designers, requires understanding UI/UX principles + writing clarity, growing field (companies like Google/Airbnb имеют large UX writing teams), technical writers с product interest often transition сюда',
