      'Product Manager — managing product development lifecycle: defining product requirements, prioritizing features, coordinating engineering/design/marketing teams, technical writers transition в PM leveraging deep product knowledge gained through documentation, understanding user needs through documentation feedback, ability translate technical concepts для stakeholders',
