      'Training Specialist / Instructional Designer — creating educational materials: developing training courses для product users, creating video tutorials и interactive e-learning modules, conducting live training sessions, technical writers с teaching passion transition в training roles (documentation knowledge translates well, adding presentation/video production skills)',
