      'Email Marketing Specialist — email campaign management: focused exclusively на email channel (automation workflows, segmentation, deliverability), internet marketers manage email alongside other channels, specialization makes sense (large e-commerce companies employ dedicated email marketers managing complex automations), integration (email nurtures leads generated от paid ads, retargeting coordinates с email messaging)',
